=2 Walkthrough
* After talking to the Campaign Ops NPC, you are to scour South San d'Oria (S) for a clickable point called "Suspicious Object"
* The Suspicious Object seems to spawn anywhere in South San d'Oria (S) and once someone touches it, it disappears immediately.
* The Suspicious Object respawns immediately in a different location. So far the point can appear at:

:* (F-6)
:* (J-9) - near {n:Voucheramme}
:* (K-8)
:* (L-7)
:* (M-5)
:* (M-7)
:* (L-9)
:* (K-10) - near {n:Chauxnatte} and {n:Alfred}
:* (I-11) - by a Chocobo

* After obtaining the object, you will obtain experience points and get a message that you quota has been met. After this occurs, go back to the Campaign Ops NPC and collect your Allied Notes.
* "Suspicious Object" does not show up on {p:Wide Scan}.

